Vendored third-party browser assets live here.

They are fetched by `scripts/vendor-assets.sh` and are deliberately NOT
committed: the file this directory exists for is htmx, and pinning it in git
would mean two places to update. `.gitignore` excludes `htmx.min.js`; the
Dockerfile and CI both run the script before the asset is needed.

    scripts/vendor-assets.sh
    # curl -fsSL https://unpkg.com/htmx.org@2.0.4/dist/htmx.min.js \
    #   -o assets/vendor/htmx.min.js
